# Header Nav Yellow Hover Lock

- Treat the yellow hover-box effect on the center header links as protected.
- Do not remove, restyle, or weaken this behavior unless the user explicitly asks.
- Protected target selectors:
  - `.main-nav a`
  - `.main-nav a::before`
  - `.main-nav a::after`
  - `.main-nav a:hover`
  - `.main-nav a:focus-visible`
  - `.main-nav a:hover::before`
  - `.main-nav a:hover::after`
  - `.main-nav a:focus-visible::before`
  - `.main-nav a:focus-visible::after`
- Required behavior to preserve:
  - Link text turns yellow on hover/focus
  - Animated yellow outline/corner box appears around each nav link
  - Smooth transition timing remains in place
